{"seq":2,"slug":"performance-optimization","title":"性能优化与成本控制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/distributed-tracing/operations/performance-optimization","wordCount":1374,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"性能优化与成本控制\">性能优化与成本控制</h1><p>分布式追踪系统在生产环境中面临一个持续的张力：数据越全面，洞察越深入；但存储、网络和计算成本也随之线性甚至超线性增长。当系统规模达到每秒数十万 Span 时，不经优化的追踪系统可能成为可观测性预算的最大消耗项。本文从数据生成、传输、存储和查询四个环节给出系统化的优化策略。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>追踪系统的成本优化遵循&quot;漏斗模型&quot;：数据在生成→传输→存储→查询每个环节都可以被精简，越上游的裁剪杠杆越大。但过度裁剪又会导致关键信号丢失。核心原则是：对无价值数据尽早丢弃，对高价值数据全量保留。</p>\n<h2 id=\"成本构成分析\">成本构成分析</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph Generate[&quot;生成端&quot;]&#10;        G1[&quot;SDK CPU 开销&quot;]&#10;        G2[&quot;序列化开销&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Transport[&quot;传输端&quot;]&#10;        T1[&quot;网络带宽&quot;]&#10;        T2[&quot;Collector CPU/内存&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Store[&quot;存储端&quot;]&#10;        S1[&quot;对象存储容量&quot;]&#10;        S2[&quot;索引存储&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Query[&quot;查询端&quot;]&#10;        Q1[&quot;扫描数据量&quot;]&#10;        Q2[&quot;查询计算资源&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    Generate --&gt; Transport&#10;    Transport --&gt; Store&#10;    Store --&gt; Query\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph Generate[\"生成端\"]\n        G1[\"SDK CPU 开销\"]\n        G2[\"序列化开销\"]\n    end\n    subgraph Transport[\"传输端\"]\n        T1[\"网络带宽\"]\n        T2[\"Collector CPU/内存\"]\n    end\n    subgraph Store[\"存储端\"]\n        S1[\"对象存储容量\"]\n        S2[\"索引存储\"]\n    end\n    subgraph Query[\"查询端\"]\n        Q1[\"扫描数据量\"]\n        Q2[\"查询计算资源\"]\n    end\n    Generate --&gt; Transport\n    Transport --&gt; Store\n    Store --&gt; Query</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>环节</th>\n<th>主要成本项</th>\n<th>占总成本比例</th>\n<th>主要优化手段</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>生成</td>\n<td>SDK CPU 和内存</td>\n<td>5-10%</td>\n<td>Span 粒度控制、条件插桩</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>传输</td>\n<td>网络带宽、Collector 资源</td>\n<td>20-30%</td>\n<td>采样、压缩、过滤</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>存储</td>\n<td>对象存储/索引存储</td>\n<td>40-50%</td>\n<td>采样、保留策略、列式压缩</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>查询</td>\n<td>计算资源（Querier CPU）</td>\n<td>15-25%</td>\n<td>索引优化、自适应采样</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"sdk-端优化\">SDK 端优化</h2><h3 id=\"span-数量控制\">Span 数量控制</h3><p>过度插桩是成本失控的首要原因。每个 Span 的全生命周期成本约为：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>单 Span 开销</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>创建 (内存分配 + 时间戳)</td>\n<td>~500ns</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Attributes 填充</td>\n<td>~200ns/attr</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>序列化 (Protobuf)</td>\n<td>~1μs</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>网络传输</td>\n<td>~500B-2KB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>后端存储</td>\n<td>~200B-500B (压缩后)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>索引/查询</td>\n<td>按扫描量计费</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>优化规则：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>做</th>\n<th>不做</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>每个外部调用一个 Span</td>\n<td>循环内每次迭代一个 Span</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>关键业务操作一个 Span</td>\n<td>纯内存计算一个 Span</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>使用 Events 替代子 Span 记录中间步骤</td>\n<td>为日志级别的细节创建 Span</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>动态启用/禁用细粒度插桩</td>\n<td>始终最大粒度插桩</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"attribute-精简\">Attribute 精简</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    ALL[&quot;全量 Attributes&lt;br/&gt;20+ 个 KV&lt;br/&gt;~2KB/Span&quot;] --&gt; FILTER[&quot;精简策略&quot;]&#10;    FILTER --&gt; ESSENTIAL[&quot;必要 Attributes&lt;br/&gt;5-8 个 KV&lt;br/&gt;~500B/Span&quot;]&#10;    FILTER --&gt; DROP[&quot;丢弃项&quot;]&#10;    DROP --&gt; D1[&quot;冗余框架内部属性&quot;]&#10;    DROP --&gt; D2[&quot;大型请求/响应体&quot;]&#10;    DROP --&gt; D3[&quot;重复的 Resource 级信息&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    ALL[\"全量 Attributes&lt;br/&gt;20+ 个 KV&lt;br/&gt;~2KB/Span\"] --&gt; FILTER[\"精简策略\"]\n    FILTER --&gt; ESSENTIAL[\"必要 Attributes&lt;br/&gt;5-8 个 KV&lt;br/&gt;~500B/Span\"]\n    FILTER --&gt; DROP[\"丢弃项\"]\n    DROP --&gt; D1[\"冗余框架内部属性\"]\n    DROP --&gt; D2[\"大型请求/响应体\"]\n    DROP --&gt; D3[\"重复的 Resource 级信息\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>保留</th>\n<th>理由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>http.request.method</code>, <code>http.response.status_code</code></td>\n<td>RED 指标必需</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>http.route</code> (非 <code>http.url</code>)</td>\n<td>低基数，适合聚合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>db.system</code>, <code>db.operation</code></td>\n<td>数据库性能分析</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>rpc.method</code>, <code>rpc.service</code></td>\n<td>RPC 调用分析</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自定义业务标识 (order_id, user_tier)</td>\n<td>业务关联</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>丢弃或截断</th>\n<th>理由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>http.url</code> (完整 URL 含查询参数)</td>\n<td>高基数，用 <code>http.route</code> 替代</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>db.statement</code> (完整 SQL)</td>\n<td>大字符串，考虑哈希或截断</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>http.request.body</code></td>\n<td>极大，绝不放入 Span</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>框架私有属性</td>\n<td>通常无查询价值</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"collector-端优化\">Collector 端优化</h2><h3 id=\"过滤无价值-span\">过滤无价值 Span</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"processors:&#10;  filter:&#10;    traces:&#10;      span:&#10;        - &#39;attributes[&quot;http.target&quot;] == &quot;/healthz&quot;&#39;&#10;        - &#39;attributes[&quot;http.target&quot;] == &quot;/readyz&quot;&#39;&#10;        - &#39;attributes[&quot;http.target&quot;] == &quot;/metrics&quot;&#39;&#10;        - &#39;name == &quot;DNS lookup&quot;&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">processors</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  filter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    traces</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      span</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'attributes[\"http.target\"] == \"/healthz\"'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'attributes[\"http.target\"] == \"/readyz\"'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'attributes[\"http.target\"] == \"/metrics\"'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'name == \"DNS lookup\"'</span></span></code></pre></div><p>健康检查和内部探测通常占全部 Span 的 30-50%，过滤后立即降低下游一半负载。</p>\n<h3 id=\"属性处理与脱敏\">属性处理与脱敏</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"processors:&#10;  attributes:&#10;    actions:&#10;      - key: db.statement&#10;        action: hash # SQL 脱敏为哈希&#10;      - key: http.url&#10;        action: delete # 删除高基数完整 URL&#10;      - key: user.email&#10;        action: delete # 删除 PII&#10;  transform:&#10;    trace_statements:&#10;      - context: span&#10;        statements:&#10;          - truncate_all(attributes, 256) # 所有值截断至 256 字符\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">processors</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  attributes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    actions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">db.statement</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        action</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">hash</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # SQL 脱敏为哈希</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">http.url</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        action</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">delete</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 删除高基数完整 URL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">user.email</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        action</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">delete</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 删除 PII</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  transform</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    trace_statements</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">context</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">span</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        statements</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">truncate_all(attributes, 256)</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 所有值截断至 256 字符</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"压缩传输\">压缩传输</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>压缩算法</th>\n<th>CPU 开销</th>\n<th>压缩比</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>none</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>1x</td>\n<td>低延迟优先</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>gzip</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>5-8x</td>\n<td>跨地域传输</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>snappy</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>3-4x</td>\n<td><strong>Tempo 默认推荐</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>zstd</td>\n<td>中-高</td>\n<td>7-10x</td>\n<td>带宽极其昂贵时</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Tempo 2.7.1 起将内部 gRPC 默认压缩设为 snappy，兼顾压缩比和 CPU。</p>\n<h2 id=\"存储端优化\">存储端优化</h2><h3 id=\"保留策略\">保留策略</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>数据类型</th>\n<th>建议保留</th>\n<th>理由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>全量 Span (采样后)</td>\n<td>7-14 天</td>\n<td>覆盖 on-call 排障周期</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TraceQL Metrics 聚合</td>\n<td>30-90 天</td>\n<td>趋势分析和 SLO</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>关键 Trace 快照</td>\n<td>1 年+</td>\n<td>合规和事后复盘</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"tempo-存储优化配置\">Tempo 存储优化配置</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>配置</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>compactor.compaction_window</code></td>\n<td>压缩时间窗口</td>\n<td>更大窗口 → 更少块 → 更快查询</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>ingester.max_block_bytes</code></td>\n<td>块大小上限</td>\n<td>更大块 → 更好压缩比</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Dedicated Columns</td>\n<td>高频属性映射为列</td>\n<td>查询加速 10x</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>vParquet5</td>\n<td>列式 + 字典编码</td>\n<td>存储减少 30-50%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"存储分层\">存储分层</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    HOT[&quot;热数据 (0-24h)&lt;br/&gt;Live Store 内存&lt;br/&gt;快速查询&quot;]&#10;    WARM[&quot;温数据 (1-7天)&lt;br/&gt;Object Storage&lt;br/&gt;标准层&quot;]&#10;    COLD[&quot;冷数据 (7-30天)&lt;br/&gt;Object Storage&lt;br/&gt;归档层&quot;]&#10;&#10;    HOT --&gt; WARM&#10;    WARM --&gt; COLD\">flowchart LR\n    HOT[\"热数据 (0-24h)&lt;br/&gt;Live Store 内存&lt;br/&gt;快速查询\"]\n    WARM[\"温数据 (1-7天)&lt;br/&gt;Object Storage&lt;br/&gt;标准层\"]\n    COLD[\"冷数据 (7-30天)&lt;br/&gt;Object Storage&lt;br/&gt;归档层\"]\n\n    HOT --&gt; WARM\n    WARM --&gt; COLD</pre><p>利用对象存储的分层（如 S3 Intelligent-Tiering），超过 7 天的数据自动转为低频访问层，成本降低 40-70%。</p>\n<h2 id=\"查询端优化\">查询端优化</h2><h3 id=\"traceql-查询最佳实践\">TraceQL 查询最佳实践</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>优化</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>缩小时间范围</td>\n<td>从 1 小时查起而非 24 小时</td>\n<td>扫描量减少 24x</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>使用 Dedicated Columns 属性</td>\n<td><code>resource.service.name</code> 比自定义属性快</td>\n<td>列式跳过</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>先过滤再聚合</td>\n<td><code>{ filter } | rate()</code> 而非 <code>{} | rate()</code> 后过滤</td>\n<td>减少中间数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>使用 <code>with(sample=true)</code></td>\n<td>自适应采样大时间范围</td>\n<td>查询速度提升数倍</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>避免 <code>select()</code> 全属性</td>\n<td>只 select 需要的字段</td>\n<td>减少 I/O</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"查询缓存策略\">查询缓存策略</h3><p>Tempo Query Frontend 支持结果缓存，对重复查询（如 Dashboard 刷新）效果显著：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>缓存层</th>\n<th>配置</th>\n<th>命中率</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Query Frontend 结果缓存</td>\n<td>Memcached/Redis</td>\n<td>30-60%（Dashboard 场景）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Object Storage 元数据缓存</td>\n<td>本地磁盘</td>\n<td>减少 LIST 调用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Bloom Filter 缓存</td>\n<td>内存</td>\n<td>加速 TraceID 查找</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"成本监控与告警\">成本监控与告警</h2><p>建立追踪系统自身的可观测性，监控关键成本指标：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>来源</th>\n<th>告警阈值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>tempo_distributor_ingress_bytes_total</code></td>\n<td>Tempo</td>\n<td>超预算 20%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>otelcol_exporter_sent_spans</code></td>\n<td>Collector</td>\n<td>突增 3x</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>otelcol_processor_filter_spans_filtered</code></td>\n<td>Collector</td>\n<td>过滤率异常变化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对象存储费用</td>\n<td>云账单</td>\n<td>月环比增长 &gt; 30%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>otel.bsp.spans.dropped</code></td>\n<td>SDK</td>\n<td>非零 = 队列溢出</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"成本优化效果量化\">成本优化效果量化</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>优化措施</th>\n<th>实施难度</th>\n<th>成本节省</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>过滤健康检查 Span</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>30-50%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Head-based 10% 采样</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>~90% (粗暴)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Tail-based 智能采样</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>70-80% (保留价值)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Attribute 精简</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>20-40%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>存储分层</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>40-70% (冷数据)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>压缩优化 (snappy→zstd)</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>15-20% (网络)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>总计 (合理组合)</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td><strong>80-95%</strong></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>追踪成本的最大来源是存储和传输，控制数据量是第一杠杆</li>\n<li>SDK 端控制 Span 粒度和 Attribute 数量是源头治理</li>\n<li>Collector 过滤健康检查可立即削减 30-50% 无价值数据</li>\n<li>智能采样（Head + Tail 组合）在保留关键链路的前提下削减 70-80% 成本</li>\n<li>存储分层和查询缓存是&quot;免费午餐&quot;级别的优化</li>\n<li>建立追踪系统自身的成本监控形成反馈闭环</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"production-deployment\">生产环境部署架构</a>：优化策略在不同部署拓扑中的落地</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../observability-engineering/sre-practices/observability-driven-dev\">可观测性驱动开发</a>：将成本意识融入日常开发实践</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"性能优化与成本控制","id":"性能优化与成本控制"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"成本构成分析","id":"成本构成分析"},{"level":2,"text":"SDK 端优化","id":"sdk-端优化"},{"level":3,"text":"Span 数量控制","id":"span-数量控制"},{"level":3,"text":"Attribute 精简","id":"attribute-精简"},{"level":2,"text":"Collector 端优化","id":"collector-端优化"},{"level":3,"text":"过滤无价值 Span","id":"过滤无价值-span"},{"level":3,"text":"属性处理与脱敏","id":"属性处理与脱敏"},{"level":3,"text":"压缩传输","id":"压缩传输"},{"level":2,"text":"存储端优化","id":"存储端优化"},{"level":3,"text":"保留策略","id":"保留策略"},{"level":3,"text":"Tempo 存储优化配置","id":"tempo-存储优化配置"},{"level":3,"text":"存储分层","id":"存储分层"},{"level":2,"text":"查询端优化","id":"查询端优化"},{"level":3,"text":"TraceQL 查询最佳实践","id":"traceql-查询最佳实践"},{"level":3,"text":"查询缓存策略","id":"查询缓存策略"},{"level":2,"text":"成本监控与告警","id":"成本监控与告警"},{"level":2,"text":"成本优化效果量化","id":"成本优化效果量化"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"生产环境部署架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/distributed-tracing/operations/production-deployment"},"next":{"title":"基于追踪的故障排查模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/distributed-tracing/operations/troubleshooting-patterns"}}